{"id":"fdeb0db348e01893","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md","title":"ZFC Top2 Quotient Topology","display":"df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology — ZFC Top2 Quotient Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology"],"display":"df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology — ZFC Top2 Quotient Topology","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology — ZFC Top2 Quotient Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_Q,q,X,Y,\\tau\\in V\">\\(\\tau_Q,q,X,Y,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> is the topology predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\)</span> is the relation-preimage predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\tau_Q,q,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(q,X,Y)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(q)=Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\n\\tau_Q=\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(Y):\\exists P\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(P,q,U)\\land P\\in\\tau)\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\tau_Q,q,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(q,X,Y)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(q)=Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\n\\tau_Q=\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(Y):\\exists P\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(P,q,U)\\land P\\in\\tau)\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The range condition makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:X\\twoheadrightarrow Y\">\\(q:X\\twoheadrightarrow Y\\)</span> explicit; openness in the quotient is defined by an actual preimage set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md","status":"resolved","id":"39c10f49239bf771","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ is the topology predicate (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ and $\\operatorname{ran}$ are as in [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md","status":"resolved","id":"39c10f49239bf771","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S$ is the relation-preimage predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-rel-preimage.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_Q,q,X,Y,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\tau_Q,q,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(q,X,Y)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(q)=Y\\\\\n&\\hspace{37mm}\\land\n\\tau_Q=\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(Y):\\exists P\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(P,q,U)\\land P\\in\\tau)\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"q:X\\twoheadrightarrow Y","display":false}],"bytes":1487,"backlinks":[{"id":"de46efac56b1e2dc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}$ 取 [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotie